y = gamma/2 + (gamma^2/2-2K/gamma)Z,
x' = 2K/gamma.
```

The definition `i=x'-2y'` pins `K=gamma^3/12`. Put
`delta=gamma-4K/gamma^2=2gamma/3`. The last row becomes

```text
