```text
2x1-4y1+gamma^2,
2gamma*y0-gamma^2,
2gamma*y1-gamma^3+4K,
gamma*x1-2K,
gamma^2*u0^2,
2gamma^4*u0*u1+K*gamma^3-4K^2,
gamma*K*tt-1.
```

